From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:08:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(compose): synchronize profiler tracker and state registry
 across threads

The recomposition profiler is fed from the Kuikly context thread (trace
start/end, frame events) and from the Snapshot apply observer thread. The
trace stack, event buffer, state-change caches and StateIdentityRegistry
were unsynchronized and threw ConcurrentModificationException on devices.
Guard each with its own lock and invoke output strategies outside the lock.

Fork-Patch: compose-profiler-tracker-concurrency
Origin: 2ee7c825 5755ac04 8412827b
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
